# Child Development: An Annotated Bibliography.

**Authors:** Dickerson, LaVerne Thornton, Comp.

## Abstract
This annotated bibliography focuses on recent publications dealing with factors that influence child growth and development, rather than the developmental processes themselves. Topics include: general sources on child development; physical and perceptual-motor development; cognitive development; social and personality development; and play. Approximately 150 entries are drawn from journals, books, book chapters, and monographs. (ED)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED116788

